msgid "Adding Resiliency: Retries"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Let the Quarkus development server running and in your IDE add the `@Retry` "
"annotation to the `CoffeeResource#coffees()`\n"
"method as follows and save the file:"
msgstr ""

